        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-2 m-2">
          
            <img src="/public/images/image 1.png" alt="png" class="w-auto h-10 mx-2 ">
          <div class="">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
              <p class="text-white ">CNN</p>
              <img src="/public/images/Group (2)0.svg" alt="">
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs">@CCN. 7m </p>
            </div>
            <div class="text-gray-500">
              <p>President Joe Biden touted a new agreement reached with the</p>
