              </div>
              <div class="text-gray-500 ">
                <div class="">
                  <p>Gardening boomed during the pandemic. Six Black writers share how it</p>
                  <p>has helped them re-establish, and reimagine, a connection to</p>
                  <p>cultivation and the land</p>
                </di>
